00:48:43.820 --> 00:48:47.820
not only the television, the media, the telephone, the papers

00:48:47.820 --> 00:48:51.820
the computers, the internet

00:48:51.820 --> 00:48:55.820
the flights to Israel, back and forth

00:48:55.860 --> 00:48:59.860
I believe in America and be in Israel at the same time

00:48:59.860 --> 00:49:03.860
yes, I don't think

00:49:03.860 --> 00:49:07.860
in my opinion, I know that many will disagree with me

00:49:07.860 --> 00:49:11.860
I don't think that you have to live in Israel

00:49:11.860 --> 00:49:15.860
to be in Israel

00:49:15.860 --> 00:49:19.860
I think that you could be an excellent Jew

00:49:19.860 --> 00:49:23.860
wherever you are, you could live in, as far as I'm concerned

00:49:23.899 --> 00:49:27.899
in any place, in a Polynesian small little island

00:49:27.899 --> 00:49:31.899
and today, if you have the computer

00:49:31.899 --> 00:49:35.899
the hardware, you could be in contact with everybody

00:49:35.899 --> 00:49:39.899
and you could be in the heart of Jerusalem and complain always

00:49:39.899 --> 00:49:43.899
we know people in the heart of Jerusalem, always complaining, this is bad

00:49:43.899 --> 00:49:47.899
so, you know, we pray also three times a day

00:49:47.899 --> 00:49:51.899
towards Jerusalem

00:49:51.939 --> 00:49:55.939
and post-modernism could be thriving

00:49:55.939 --> 00:49:59.939
in Chicago, too

00:49:59.939 --> 00:50:03.939
you mention Jews

00:50:03.939 --> 00:50:07.939
being a paradigm for man through time

00:50:07.939 --> 00:50:11.939
to Halakha through time

00:50:11.939 --> 00:50:15.939
and the obliteration of space through technology

00:50:15.939 --> 00:50:19.939
but where do people today reclaim their sense of values

00:50:19.979 --> 00:50:23.979
post-modernism has done its work on us

00:50:23.979 --> 00:50:27.979
and people are nihilistic and valueless

00:50:27.979 --> 00:50:31.979
first of all, I appreciate and I welcome this question

00:50:31.979 --> 00:50:35.979
because you touch a very sensitive point

00:50:35.979 --> 00:50:39.979
I think that the destruction of the obliteration

00:50:39.979 --> 00:50:43.979
of modernity, the ideology of the Enlightenment

00:50:43.979 --> 00:50:47.979
needs to be answered

00:50:48.020 --> 00:50:52.020
a building came down

00:50:52.020 --> 00:50:56.020
but now we have to light the candle

00:50:56.020 --> 00:51:00.020
and it's time for Jews to speak up

00:51:00.020 --> 00:51:04.020
America is a great country because it is a true democracy

00:51:04.020 --> 00:51:08.020
and it gives us the right to speak

00:51:08.020 --> 00:51:12.020
and we should speak

00:51:12.020 --> 00:51:16.020
about Jewish values

00:51:16.060 --> 00:51:20.060
in the non-Jewish community, some people speak about their religion

00:51:20.060 --> 00:51:24.060
in a very aggressive way, I don't think we should speak aggressively

00:51:24.060 --> 00:51:28.060
but yes, we should point out

00:51:28.060 --> 00:51:32.060
to those elements in Judaism

00:51:32.060 --> 00:51:36.060
that could make the life of all of us richer

00:51:36.060 --> 00:51:40.060
our children, our grandchildren realize

00:51:40.060 --> 00:51:44.060
that this state kind of bliss dreamt by Rousseau

00:51:44.100 --> 00:51:48.100
and company is not meaningful

00:51:48.100 --> 00:51:52.100
drugs, other things

00:51:52.100 --> 00:51:56.100
are the effect of disillusionment

00:51:56.100 --> 00:52:00.100
with the structure of the Enlightenment, of the French Revolution

00:52:00.100 --> 00:52:04.100
we want something better than a revolution

00:52:04.100 --> 00:52:08.100
and we as Jews should speak up

00:52:08.100 --> 00:52:12.100
and I want to tell you something very important

00:52:12.139 --> 00:52:16.139
I'm an intellectual

00:52:16.139 --> 00:52:20.139
I read different kind of literature

00:52:20.139 --> 00:52:24.139
and for me, I'm prejudiced

00:52:24.139 --> 00:52:28.139
I want to speak to you

00:52:28.139 --> 00:52:32.139
and I'm not embarrassed

00:52:32.139 --> 00:52:36.139
about my first love, the first woman

00:52:36.139 --> 00:52:40.139
I loved

00:52:40.179 --> 00:52:44.179
is my model

00:52:44.179 --> 00:52:48.179
I'm not embarrassed to say it, my grandmother

00:52:48.179 --> 00:52:52.179
the Jewish grandmothers that were imbued in Jewish culture

00:52:52.179 --> 00:52:56.179
they knew Judaism

00:52:56.179 --> 00:53:00.179
not because they read it in books

00:53:00.179 --> 00:53:04.179
because they lived it

00:53:04.179 --> 00:53:08.179
and I think it's time for Jewish grandmothers, grandfathers, etc

00:53:08.219 --> 00:53:12.219
to stand up and teach

00:53:12.219 --> 00:53:16.219
the grandchildren

00:53:16.219 --> 00:53:20.219
the direction of halakha, that there is a road

00:53:20.219 --> 00:53:24.219
there is an itinerary

00:53:24.219 --> 00:53:28.219
we have mapped the route for 2000 years

00:53:28.219 --> 00:53:32.219
and we have to point

00:53:32.219 --> 00:53:36.219
the direction, it's high time for grandparents

00:53:37.219 --> 00:53:41.219
I'm prejudiced, grandmothers, because I loved

00:53:41.219 --> 00:53:45.219
my grandmother was my light

00:53:45.219 --> 00:53:49.219
the torch, she illuminated my life

00:53:49.219 --> 00:53:53.219
the grandmothers to stand up and speak

00:53:53.219 --> 00:53:57.219
that's my answer

00:53:57.219 --> 00:54:01.219
If it develops according to your suggestion

00:54:01.219 --> 00:54:05.219
that in addition to our halakha, there will be a variety

00:54:05.219 --> 00:54:09.219
in the future of Halachot that will be adopted by the post-modern world

00:54:09.219 --> 00:54:13.219
what then would our reason for sticking with our

00:54:13.219 --> 00:54:17.219
particular version of halakha be according to your ideas?

00:54:17.219 --> 00:54:21.219
I believe, again

00:54:21.219 --> 00:54:25.219
the questions are fantastic

00:54:25.219 --> 00:54:29.219
I'll compliment the lecture

00:54:29.219 --> 00:54:33.219
it's an appropriate question

00:54:33.219 --> 00:54:37.219
I could follow my halakha

00:54:37.219 --> 00:54:41.219
where I could follow a non-Jewish halakha

00:54:41.219 --> 00:54:45.219
and now I'm not talking in the name of my grandmother

00:54:45.219 --> 00:54:49.219
I don't know if my grandmother would be able to answer this

00:54:49.219 --> 00:54:53.219
but my grandfather will, he was able to answer this

00:54:53.219 --> 00:54:57.219
he was a businessman

00:54:57.219 --> 00:55:01.219
and he believed something which is very Jewish, competition

00:55:01.219 --> 00:55:05.219
and if you have competing business

00:55:05.219 --> 00:55:09.219
you have to improve the quality of your merchandise

00:55:09.219 --> 00:55:13.219
and if we Jewish people were not going to

00:55:13.219 --> 00:55:17.219
improve the quality of our merchandise

00:55:17.219 --> 00:55:21.219
our children are going to shop in another

00:55:21.219 --> 00:55:25.219
cyber space

00:55:25.219 --> 00:55:29.219
and yes, I hope there is a good competition

00:55:29.219 --> 00:55:33.219
we learn from each other

00:55:33.219 --> 00:55:37.219
and I hope we become better and better and better

00:55:37.219 --> 00:55:41.219
the only way, you cannot strive

00:55:41.219 --> 00:55:45.219
you cannot strangle competition, become better

00:55:45.219 --> 00:55:49.219
if we never become better, our children are going to say goodbye

00:55:49.219 --> 00:55:53.219
any other questions?

00:55:53.219 --> 00:55:57.219
well, thank you again

00:55:57.219 --> 00:56:01.219
my pleasure
